# Go
/kivgraph
*.test
*.out
# `go build ./benchmarks/x/` writes the executable into the working directory, so
# a build from the repository root leaves it here. Build with `-o /tmp/...`
# instead; these two have been committed by accident before.
/mcp-token-cost
/rust-engine

